---
source: crates/wows-query/tests/game_data.rs
expression: "json!({\n    \"ranking\": lines.ranking, \"lines\": reset_ranks(LineOrder::ResetCost)\n})"
---
ranking: "reset_cost.mean_rank is the mean of the line's rank by credits_per_point and its rank by xp_per_point among all lines matching the filters, listed or omitted (1 is cheapest; equal values share a rank). Lines go from the lowest mean_rank; ties go by credits_per_point, then xp_per_point."
